    "Applies to the app's own windows. Panels that float over your wallpaper — the monitor board's controls and the media previews — stay dark whichever you pick, because following a light system appearance would make them white over your wallpaper." : {
      "comment" : "Appearance row tooltip: the override covers app windows, not the wallpaper-level chrome.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Applies to the app's own windows. Panels that float over your wallpaper — the monitor board's controls and the media previews — stay dark whichever you pick, because following a light system appearance would make them white over your wallpaper."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se aplica a las ventanas de la propia app. Los paneles que flotan sobre tu fondo de pantalla — los controles del panel Monitor y las vistas previas de contenido — permanecen oscuros sea cual sea tu elección, porque seguir una apariencia clara del sistema los dejaría blancos sobre el fondo."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "アプリ自身のウインドウに適用されます。壁紙の上に浮かぶパネル（モニターボードのコントロールやメディアプレビュー）は、どちらを選んでも暗いままです。ライトに追従すると壁紙の上で白くなってしまうためです。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "作用于 app 自己的窗口。浮在壁纸之上的面板（监控板的控件、媒体预览）无论选哪个都保持深色——跟随浅色外观会让它们在壁纸上变成白的。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "作用於 app 自己的視窗。浮在桌布之上的面板（監控板的控制項、媒體預覽）無論選哪個都保持深色——跟隨淺色外觀會讓它們在桌布上變成白的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
