    },
    "Captures this video's current frame at lock and sets it as the macOS desktop picture." : {
      "comment" : "Tooltip for the lock-screen capture control on the preview overlay.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Captures this video's current frame at lock and sets it as the macOS desktop picture."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Captura el fotograma actual de este vídeo al bloquear y lo establece como imagen de escritorio de macOS."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ロック時にこの動画の現在のフレームを取り込み、macOS のデスクトップピクチャに設定します。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "锁屏时截取这个视频的当前帧,并设为 macOS 的桌面图片。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "鎖定時擷取這個影片的當前影格,並設為 macOS 的桌面圖片。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cards refract the wallpaper behind them, the way Apple's own widgets do. Each card re-samples what is behind it every frame, so a busy live wallpaper under a full board costs more energy than the painted cards." : {
      "comment" : "Monitor settings explanation for the Liquid Glass option, including its energy cost.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cards refract the wallpaper behind them, the way Apple's own widgets do. Each card re-samples what is behind it every frame, so a busy live wallpaper under a full board costs more energy than the painted cards."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Las tarjetas refractan el fondo de pantalla que hay detrás, como los widgets de Apple. Cada tarjeta vuelve a muestrear lo que tiene detrás en cada fotograma, así que un fondo animado con mucho movimiento bajo un panel completo consume más energía que las tarjetas pintadas."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple 純正ウィジェットと同じように、カードが背後の壁紙を屈折させます。各カードは毎フレーム背後を再サンプリングするため、動きの多い壁紙の上に多数の計器を並べると、描画カードより電力を消費します。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "卡片会像 Apple 自家小组件那样折射背后的壁纸。每张卡片每帧都会重新采样背后的内容，所以在动态壁纸上摆满仪表时，比绘制卡片更耗电。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "卡片會像 Apple 自家小工具那樣折射背後的桌布。每張卡片每一影格都會重新取樣背後的內容，所以在動態桌布上擺滿儀表時，比繪製卡片更耗電。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Carries wallpaper, playback and overlay" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Carries wallpaper, playback and overlay"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Incluye fondo, reproducción y superposición"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "壁紙・再生設定・オーバーレイを保持"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "包含壁纸、播放设置与叠加层"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "包含桌布、播放設定與疊加層"
          }
        }
      }
    },
