    "LiveWallpaper will release its read access to the local Apple Aerials folder. Existing aerial wallpapers stay applied; you'll need to reconnect to browse the library again." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen will release its read access to the local Apple Aerials folder. Existing aerial wallpapers stay applied; you'll need to reconnect to browse the library again."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen liberará el acceso de lectura a la carpeta local de Apple Aerials. Los fondos de Apple Aerials ya aplicados se mantienen; tendrás que volver a conectar para explorar la biblioteca de nuevo."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen はローカルの Apple Aerials フォルダへの読み取りアクセスを解除します。適用中の空撮壁紙はそのまま維持されます。ライブラリを再度表示するには再接続が必要です。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen 将释放对本地 Apple Aerials 文件夹的读取权限。已应用的航拍壁纸保持不变；如需再次浏览图库，请重新连接。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen 將釋放對本機 Apple Aerials 資料夾的讀取權限。已套用的空拍桌布維持；再次瀏覽圖庫需重新連線。"
