        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen 会把视频的副本交给 macOS,所以退出 app 之后它仍会继续播放。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen 會把影片的副本交給 macOS,所以結束 app 之後它仍會繼續播放。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Loomscreen is quitting." : {
      "comment" : "Scene import refused because the app is shutting down.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen is quitting."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen se está cerrando."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen を終了しています。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen 正在退出。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen 正在結束。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Loomscreen never asks for Full Disk Access. Library access comes from one folder you pick, stored as a security-scoped bookmark." : {
      "comment" : "Workshop privacy point about file access.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen never asks for Full Disk Access. Library access comes from one folder you pick, stored as a security-scoped bookmark."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen nunca pide Acceso total al disco. El acceso a la biblioteca proviene de una carpeta que eliges, guardada como marcador con ámbito de seguridad."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen はフルディスクアクセスを要求しません。ライブラリへのアクセスは、選択した 1 つのフォルダに対するセキュリティスコープ付きブックマークに基づきます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen 从不要求完全磁盘访问权限。库访问仅来自你选择的那一个文件夹，以安全作用域书签的形式保存。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen 從不要求完全磁碟取用權限。資料庫存取僅來自你選擇的那一個資料夾，以安全範圍書籤的形式保存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Loomscreen never reads your Steam password — only this key, stored locally on this Mac." : {
      "comment" : "Secondary reassurance under the API-key-required state and entry sheet.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen nunca lee tu contraseña de Steam — solo esta clave, almacenada localmente en este Mac."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen が Steam パスワードを読み取ることはありません — このキーだけを、この Mac 上にローカル保存します。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen 绝不会读取你的 Steam 密码 — 只读取此密钥，并且只存储在此 Mac 本地。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen 絕不會讀取你的 Steam 密碼 — 只讀取此金鑰，並且只儲存在此 Mac 本機。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Loomscreen reads installed Workshop items directly from the official Steam library after one folder authorization. Authenticated SteamCMD downloads are a separate capability and require Loomscreen's background Steam connector." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen reads installed Workshop items directly from the official Steam library after one folder authorization. Authenticated SteamCMD downloads are a separate capability and require Loomscreen's background Steam connector."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tras autorizar una carpeta, Loomscreen lee los elementos de Workshop instalados directamente desde la biblioteca oficial de Steam. Las descargas autenticadas con SteamCMD son una capacidad aparte y requieren el conector de Steam en segundo plano de Loomscreen."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "フォルダを一度許可すると、Loomscreen はインストール済みのワークショップアイテムを公式 Steam ライブラリから直接読み取ります。認証が必要な SteamCMD ダウンロードは別機能で、Loomscreen のバックグラウンド Steam コネクタが必要です。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "授权文件夹一次后，Loomscreen 会直接从官方 Steam 库读取已安装的创意工坊项目。经过身份验证的 SteamCMD 下载是独立功能，需要 Loomscreen 的后台 Steam 连接器。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "授權資料夾一次後，Loomscreen 會直接從官方 Steam 收藏庫讀取已安裝的創意工坊項目。經過身分驗證的 SteamCMD 下載是獨立功能，需要 Loomscreen 的背景 Steam 連線器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Loomscreen reads installed Workshop items directly from the official Steam library after one folder authorization. macOS only grants that through a panel you confirm, so even a folder Loomscreen already located needs one click." : {
      "comment" : "Onboarding Steam library step explanation.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tras autorizar una carpeta, Loomscreen lee los elementos de Workshop instalados directamente desde la biblioteca oficial de Steam. macOS solo lo concede en un panel que confirmas, así que incluso una carpeta que Loomscreen ya localizó necesita un clic."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "フォルダを一度許可すれば、Loomscreen は公式 Steam ライブラリからインストール済みのワークショップアイテムを直接読み取ります。macOS はこれをユーザーが確認したパネル経由でしか許可しないため、Loomscreen がすでに見つけたフォルダでも 1 回のクリックが必要です。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "只需授权一次文件夹，Loomscreen 就能直接从官方 Steam 库读取已安装的创意工坊项目。macOS 只在你确认的面板里授权，所以即使 Loomscreen 已经找到了文件夹，也仍需点一次。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "只需授權一次資料夾，Loomscreen 就能直接從官方 Steam 收藏庫讀取已安裝的創意工坊項目。macOS 只在你確認的面板裡授權，所以即使 Loomscreen 已經找到了資料夾，也仍需點一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Loomscreen won't run a SteamCMD from inside its own container." : {
      "comment" : "Workshop setup error when the chosen SteamCMD sits in the app's own container.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen won't run a SteamCMD from inside its own container."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen no ejecutará un SteamCMD desde su propio contenedor."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen は自身のコンテナ内にある SteamCMD を実行しません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen 不会运行位于自身容器内的 SteamCMD。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen 不會執行位於自身容器內的 SteamCMD。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Loomscreen's background Steam helper didn't answer. Downloads won't run until it does — quitting and reopening Loomscreen usually starts it." : {
      "comment" : "Connector diagnostic when the XPC service is unreachable.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El asistente de Steam en segundo plano de Loomscreen no respondió. Las descargas no se ejecutarán hasta que lo haga — salir y volver a abrir Loomscreen suele iniciarlo."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen のバックグラウンド Steam ヘルパーが応答しませんでした。応答するまでダウンロードは実行できません。Loomscreen を終了して開き直すと起動することがほとんどです。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen 的后台 Steam 助手没有响应。在它响应之前无法下载 —— 退出并重新打开 Loomscreen 通常就能启动它。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen 的背景 Steam 輔助程式沒有回應。在它回應之前無法下載 —— 結束並重新開啟 Loomscreen 通常就能啟動它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Loomscreen's Steam connector did not respond, so the signature wasn't checked." : {
      "comment" : "SteamCMD diagnostic (Doctor) probe label or result message.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
