    "The information below will be pre-filled into a GitHub issue. **Review it before posting** — once an issue is created, anyone can read it." : {
      "comment" : "Explainer body in the Report a Bug sheet.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The information below will be pre-filled into a GitHub issue. **Review it before posting** — once an issue is created, anyone can read it."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La información siguiente se rellenará de antemano en un issue de GitHub. **Revísala antes de publicarla** — una vez creado el issue, cualquiera puede leerlo."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "下記の情報は GitHub issue に事前入力されます。**投稿前に内容をご確認ください** — issue は誰でも閲覧できます。"
