    },
    "The lock screen plays unless low power or heat slows it. This is what happens after you unlock." : {
      "comment" : "Explains that the desktop playback picker does not govern the lock screen, which still throttles on low power or heat.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The lock screen plays unless low power or heat slows it. This is what happens after you unlock."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La pantalla bloqueada se reproduce salvo que el bajo consumo o el calor la ralenticen. Esto es lo que ocurre después de desbloquear."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ロック画面は、低電力モードや発熱による減速がない限り再生されます。ここで設定するのはロック解除後の動作です。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "除非低电量或过热导致降速,锁屏都会播放。这里设置的是解锁之后的表现。"
