    "When it finishes, use Locate automatically and Loomscreen will pick it up." : {
      "comment" : "Homebrew instructions sheet footer note.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When it finishes, use Locate automatically and Loomscreen will pick it up."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cuando termine, usa Localizar automáticamente y Loomscreen lo detectará."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "完了したら「自動的に検出」を使えば Loomscreen が認識します。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "装好后点“自动定位”，Loomscreen 会自动识别。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "裝好後點「自動定位」，Loomscreen 會自動識別。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When off, captures show the static macOS desktop picture instead. Turning it off also keeps a full-screen animation out of a shared meeting stream, which can cut the bandwidth it costs. The Monitor overlay follows this setting too." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When off, captures show the static macOS desktop picture instead. Turning it off also keeps a full-screen animation out of a shared meeting stream, which can cut the bandwidth it costs. The Monitor overlay follows this setting too."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si está desactivado, las capturas muestran la imagen de escritorio estática de macOS. Desactivarlo también evita que una animación a pantalla completa entre en una transmisión de reunión compartida, lo que puede reducir el ancho de banda que consume. La superposición Monitor también sigue este ajuste."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "オフにすると、代わりに macOS の静止したデスクトップピクチャが写ります。全画面のアニメーションが会議の共有映像に含まれなくなるため、必要な帯域を抑えられます。モニターオーバーレイもこの設定に従います。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "关闭后，截取到的是 macOS 的静态桌面图片。关闭还能让全屏动画不进入会议共享画面，从而降低占用的带宽。监控叠加层也跟随此设置。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "關閉後，擷取到的是 macOS 的靜態桌面圖片。關閉還能讓全螢幕動畫不進入會議共享畫面，從而降低佔用的頻寬。監控疊加層也跟隨此設定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When off, the app keeps running in the background — reopen this window anytime from the menu bar icon at the top-right of your screen." : {
      "comment" : "Text displayed in a setting row that lets the user toggle whether the app appears in the Dock and the Cmd-Tab switcher.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si está desactivado, la app sigue en segundo plano — puedes volver a abrir esta ventana cuando quieras desde el icono de la barra de menús, en la esquina superior derecha de la pantalla."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "オフにしてもアプリはバックグラウンドで実行されます — 画面右上のメニューバーアイコンからいつでもこのウインドウを開き直せます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "关闭时，App 会继续在后台运行 — 你随时可以从屏幕右上角的菜单栏图标重新打开此窗口。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "關閉時，App 會繼續在背景執行 — 你隨時可以從螢幕右上角的選單列圖示重新開啟此視窗。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When on, clicks and scrolls reach the wallpaper but desktop icons and the Dock become unclickable. Off lets you use Finder normally." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When on, clicks and scrolls reach the wallpaper but desktop icons and the Dock become unclickable. Off lets you use Finder normally."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si está activado, los clics y el desplazamiento llegan al fondo de pantalla, pero los iconos del escritorio y el Dock dejan de ser clicables. Desactivado te permite usar Finder con normalidad."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "オンの場合、クリックとスクロールは壁紙に届きますが、デスクトップアイコンと Dock はクリックできなくなります。オフにすると Finder を通常どおり使用できます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "开启后，鼠标点击与滚动作用于壁纸，但桌面图标和 Dock 将无法点击；关闭则可正常使用 Finder。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "開啟時，點按和捲動會傳到桌布，但桌面圖示和 Dock 將無法點按。關閉則可正常使用 Finder。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When on, the wallpaper's WKWebView starts fresh each session — cookies, localStorage, and cache are not persisted" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When on, the wallpaper's WKWebView starts fresh each session — cookies, localStorage, and cache are not persisted"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si está activado, el WKWebView del fondo de pantalla empieza de cero en cada sesión — las cookies, localStorage y la caché no se conservan"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "オンの場合、壁紙の WKWebView はセッションごとに新規開始します。cookies、localStorage、キャッシュは保持されません"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "开启后，壁纸的 WKWebView 每次会话都会重新开始——Cookie、localStorage 和缓存不会保留"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "開啟時，桌布的 WKWebView 每次工作階段都會全新啟動；cookies、localStorage 和快取不會保留"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When on, the wallpaper's WKWebView starts fresh each session — cookies, localStorage, and cache are not persisted." : {
      "comment" : "Accessibility label for the toggle that lets users choose whether to clear browsing data when the wallpaper exits.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When on, the wallpaper's WKWebView starts fresh each session — cookies, localStorage, and cache are not persisted."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si está activado, el WKWebView del fondo de pantalla empieza de cero en cada sesión — las cookies, localStorage y la caché no se conservan."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "オンの場合、壁紙の WKWebView はセッションごとに新規開始します。cookies、localStorage、キャッシュは保持されません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "开启后，壁纸的 WKWebView 每次会话都会全新启动——Cookie、localStorage 和缓存不会保留。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "開啟時，桌布的 WKWebView 每次工作階段都會全新啟動；cookies、localStorage 和快取不會保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When open windows cover about 85 percent or more of a display, the wallpaper pauses to free CPU and GPU. It resumes as soon as you reveal the desktop." : {
      "comment" : "Accessibility hint for the \"Pause when windows cover the desktop\" setting.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When open windows cover about 85 percent or more of a display, the wallpaper pauses to free CPU and GPU. It resumes as soon as you reveal the desktop."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cuando las ventanas abiertas cubren alrededor del 85 por ciento o más de una pantalla, el fondo de pantalla se pausa para liberar CPU y GPU. Se reanuda en cuanto muestras el escritorio."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "開いているウインドウがディスプレイの約 85 パーセント以上を覆うと、CPU と GPU を空けるため壁紙が一時停止します。デスクトップを表示するとすぐ再開します。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当打开的窗口覆盖某个显示器约百分之 85 或更多区域时，壁纸会暂停以释放 CPU 和 GPU。只要露出桌面就会恢复。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "當開啟的視窗覆蓋某個顯示器約百分之 85 或更多區域時，桌布會暫停以釋放 CPU 和 GPU。只要露出桌面就會恢復。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When windows cover about half the screen, or your Mac is unplugged and wallpapers keep playing, the frame rate drops to about half to save GPU power. Full speed returns once the desktop is visible again. Affects scene (Wallpaper Engine) wallpapers." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When windows cover about half the screen, or your Mac is unplugged and wallpapers keep playing, the frame rate drops to about half to save GPU power. Full speed returns once the desktop is visible again. Affects scene (Wallpaper Engine) wallpapers."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cuando las ventanas cubren aproximadamente la mitad de la pantalla, o el Mac está desenchufado y los fondos de pantalla siguen reproduciéndose, los fotogramas por segundo bajan a la mitad para ahorrar energía de la GPU. La velocidad completa vuelve cuando el escritorio es visible de nuevo. Afecta a los fondos de pantalla de escena (Wallpaper Engine)."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ウインドウが画面の約半分を覆っているとき、または電源に接続されていない状態で壁紙が再生され続けているとき、GPU の電力を節約するためフレームレートが約半分に下がります。デスクトップが再び表示されると通常の速度に戻ります。シーン（Wallpaper Engine）壁紙に適用されます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当窗口遮挡约一半屏幕，或拔下电源后壁纸仍在播放时，帧率会降到约一半以节省 GPU 功耗。桌面重新可见后恢复全速。适用于场景（Wallpaper Engine）壁纸。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "當視窗遮擋約一半螢幕，或拔下電源後桌布仍在播放時，影格率會降到約一半以節省 GPU 功耗。桌面重新可見後恢復全速。適用於場景（Wallpaper Engine）桌布。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
